ter explain economyMission circular economy icon shows remaining resources supply\\ - 2026-10-07ChangedMinor UI tweaks to improve visibility\\ - 2026-10-06ChangedMinor UI tweaks to improve consistency and clarity","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-15T08:46:17Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706676842","verified_at":"2026-10-20T17:02:26Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4760080-1845383656393546","game_id":"steam-4760080","kind":"announcement","title":"Improved operation screen in demo","summary":"Improved operation deploy screen to remove pop-up dialog and use the operation map instead.Changelog\\ - 2026-10-02ChangedBuild operation action now uses map instead of a dialog\\ - 2026-10-02AddedAsteroids in the operation screenExplosions in the opertion screen indicating conflict areasChangedDeploy in operation now uses map instead of a dialogFixedSound was too loud for radar pings","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-05T14:06:06Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1845383656393546","verified_at":"2026-10-20T17:02:26Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4760080-1844751498226743","game_id":"steam-4760080","kind":"announcement","title":"A2A Missiles improved & balance fixes for demo","summary":"Asteroid-to-asteroid missile fixes and addition of \"Randomize on deploy\" is the highlight of this update. There are bunch of small balance and bug fixes as well, see below. Enjoy!I also work on an Operation Editor and improved operations, but this version needs much more testing so I plan another playtest for the 2nd half of the October, 2026. If you are interested in getting an early build, join Discord.Changelog: - 2026-09-24AddedProduction and warehouse data for enemy asteroidsRandomize on de","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-26T08:05:06Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1844751498226743","verified_at":"2026-10-20T17:02:26Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4760080-1842846814452974","game_id":"steam-4760080","kind":"announcement","title":"Beta of DEMO version 0.12.0 available for testing","summary":"Beta of new version with major changes such as base level 2 or missile base is ready for testing. I will wait for couple of days before making it an official demo build. Your feedback is more than welcome! Change Log - 2026-09-07 Play with advanced technologies in MISSION 5 or using PLAYER ADV card. Deploy level 2 base or missile base to wreck your enemy bases. Added Base level 2 for player, see USER MISSION / PLAYER ADV Missile base for player, see USER MISSION / PLAYER ADV Operation mission ra","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-07T12:27:00Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1842846814452974","verified_at":"2026-10-20T17:02:26Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4760080-1842212951310295","game_id":"steam-4760080","kind":"announcement","title":"Release 0.11.4: Sound and tutorial fixes","summary":"- 2026-08-31Focus of this release is sound improvements and minor tutorial fixes.ChangedImproved mission soundscape to remove clickingMission sounds now respect 2D positioning of the sourceDisabled repeated background effectsSound engine and mission soundsFixedTutorial could hang if player was too quick","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-31T13:58:50Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1842212951310295","verified_at":"2026-10-20T17:02:26Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4760080-1842212951302598","game_id":"steam-4760080","kind":"announcement","title":"Demo released!","summary":"The demo is out! If you have 15 minutes and need to scratch a strategy itch, give it a try - it's 100MB download only and after 3 minutes tutorial, you can dive directly into one of the four MISSIONS with increasing difficulty. If you have more time (about an hour), the OPERATION is great too!I'll keep developing the game and updating both playtest and the demo, so your feedback is important more than ever now.","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-28T09:35:04Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1842212951302598","verified_at":"2026-10-20T17:02:26Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4760080-1841579228663059","game_id":"steam-4760080","kind":"announcement","title":"Demo release planned for August 28th","summary":"Playtest runs for more than a month now and I did not get many issue reports, so it seems to be working just fine. I decided to take another step on the journey and I plan to release demo on August 28th.What doest it mean for you?Official demo will be available with one operation and a few predefined missions.Playtest will become closed again.You will not have access to Custom Missions as they will be part of the full release.If you want to keep playtesting, let me know and I'll consider issuing","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-19T15:51:07Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1841579228663059","verified_at":"2026-10-20T17:02:26Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-4760080":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T14:07:06Z","status":"ok","all_sou